### Summary of Relationships

- **G1 -> G2, G3 [AND]**  
- **G2 -> G2.1, G2.2 [OR]**  
- **G2.1 -> AT1, AT2, AT3 [AND]**  
- **G2.2 -> AT4, AT5, AT6 [AND]**  
- **G3 -> G3.1, G3.2 [OR]**  
- **G3.1 -> AT7, AT8, AT9 [AND]**  
- **G3.2 -> AT10, AT11, AT12 [AND]**  

This goal model effectively decomposes the mission into manageable sub-goals and tasks, ensuring that both food delivery and dish retrieval are handled efficiently with the appropriate use of multi-robot systems.
